abstract: >-
  Version 0.4 preserves the v0.3 leading-term manuscript and adds a separate
  proof note, internally versioned 0.1, proposing an effective parabolic
  remainder estimate and a second perimeter-deficit term for fixed planar C3
  convex bodies with strictly positive curvature. Endpoint exponents, a
  three-dimensional second term and flat or singular curvature are not
  claimed. No independent human mathematical review is attested.
